msgid "please confirm sign out"
msgstr "confirmer votre déconnexion"

#. From: konnect##chooseaccount##subHeader
#: konnect##chooseaccount##subHeader
msgid "to sign in"
msgstr "identification"

#. From: konnect##goodbye##subHeader
